{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TANK 2025</strong> is a top-down tank shooter with 2D pixel art visuals that brings the classic arcade spirit back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features 12 short but intense levels and can be completed in about an hour \u2014 perfect for players seeking a nostalgic action experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins when Queen Melike, whose nation is threatened by a hostile regime, sends her most trusted soldier, Colonel Quade Morning, into battle in his legendary yellow tank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across snowy fields, rivers, forests, and steel fortresses. Defend your base, destroy waves of enemy tanks, use your reflexes, and advance to the next level before you run out of lives.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player only</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 unique levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-style combat with pixel art graphics</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3847210?t=1753444188","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3847210?t=1753444188","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847210/db6d1836381c769a700638fc1d2bad057df6d71e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753444188","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847210/db6d1836381c769a700638fc1d2bad057df6d71e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753444188","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There is no nudity or sexual content in the game. One female character wears a short skirt in some story cutscenes, showing only her knees. The content is not suggestive and remains within cartoon-style visuals."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_